        <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">double a = 5/2 </span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">的右侧先按整数规则运算，得到</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">2</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">后才转换为</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">double</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">。显式转换其中一个操作数后才进行除法，可以保留小数。</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">float</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">、</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">double</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">转换为整数时丢弃小数部分，向零截断；值须处于目标整数类型可表示的范围内。不能依靠事后强制转换恢复已丢弃的小数。</span></p>
        <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">追问：(double)(5/2) 结果是多少？答案2.0。</span></p>
      </content>
    </note>
  </slide>
  